<p>31st Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions to run for the seat held by Ald. Felix Cardona Jr.; on the Chicago Board of Elections candidate list as of Oct. 30, 2026. No campaign website or platform found.</p>
